{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2023-04", "window": 1, "start_date": 1680307200, "end_date": 1680911999, "month_true_total": 57, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:53:17 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "136259223", "author": {"steamid": "76561198000706982", "personaname": "cacy lord", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/feekeefighter/", "num_games_owned": 716, "num_reviews": 161, "playtime_forever": 2983, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1563, "last_played": 1779152886, "avatar": "75dd1f5fe7b4369df4e24b6959ed8578270be286"}, "language": "english", "review": "its insane, the devs don't even realize the absolute gold they've struck with this game, in this state its perfect, online works well, fun missions, plenty of dumb weapons lots of stuff to do, but otherwise it's kinda barebones, just lots of big bugs to shoot which is fine, just kinda surprised that with each new game there's really nothing new and the dlc is either a few missions or gimmick weapons, like there could atleast be some qol things like  better camera, more options, better levels that are less flat don't look like a diorama, improvements to vehicles like the helicopter and it's awful controls and speed. seriously the things rotors literally slow down and stop half the time. maybe some new features like difficulty modifiers, some light weapon mod system like stun time, knockback, double shot, whatever. random side objectives for more loot, idk something actually new or improved would be tight, its dated looking and feeling, janky game but its sick compared to most new games, they just gotta do more with it", "timestamp_created": 1680857721, "timestamp_updated": 1680857721, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_acces